### Get all product types

GET http://localhost:5000/api/product_types
Content-Type: application/json

### Get product type with id

GET http://localhost:5000/api/product_types/1
Content-Type: application/json

### Create product type

POST http://localhost:5000/api/product_types
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "device",
  "description": "Electronic device"
}

### Update product type

PUT http://localhost:5000/api/product_types
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "code": "device",
  "description": "Updated type description"
}

### Delete product type with id

DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/product_types/1
Content-Type: application/json
